{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず一昨日の音楽のちから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくれましたか～???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昭和のヒットメドレーなどをたくさんの芸人さん達と歌って踊らせてもらいました❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～...森三中さん可愛かったなぁ～......❤❤❤❤笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通に皆さん歌われてる時は、一視聴者として楽しんで見てました。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、高校で同じクラスだったE-girlsの真波と萩花と共演ということで久々に会えてテンション上がってしまった(^^)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/07/08/7027848/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/07/08/7027848/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみが幼く見えるよ。おもちろい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"萩花ウエスト細すぎそして私は腹からシャツはみ出してるアホ。(^^)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/07/08/7027848/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度遊ぼーねー❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からの次の日、名古屋全国握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりすぎてなんだか緊張したんだだだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欠席の生ちゃんポジションに入ってガールズルール踊りました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ちゃんの透明感を一生懸命出してたつもりよー(^^)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなんと初披露のコウモリよ歌わせていただぎました！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ど、どどどどどどうでした？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタンドマイクで歌うのってなんだか気持ち良いですね、なんていうか俺の歌だぜって感じで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんもしっかり押しタオル持ってきてくれて歌中も一緒にぶんぶん振り回してくれたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージから見た感じがめっちゃ迫力があって思わず「うわあ」って声出しちゃいました❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれを是非もっと大きい会場で歌いたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでねえ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「2階席のみんなも、もーりあがっていくずぇーーーーーー！！！！！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言いたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会ペアの抽選では、あみが優里を引いてペアは初の優里と！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかおもちろいコンビだよね(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会中も優里のファンの皆さん元気な方が多くて、あみももうナチュラルハイ状態だったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若干いつもよりテンション高くてうざめだったかもしれない私。すいませーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優里の机斜めになるまで手離さない術で何度机をなおしたかわからない。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよ(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/07/08/7027848/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ族のみんないつもありがとうねー❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あみあみ頑張れ」って書いてある大きい垂れ幕も嬉しかった（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るよーあみは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついてこいっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/07/08/7027848/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真顔"}],"source":"archive"}